As a Wizard, Famine and Pestilence won't be too difficult since you can
finger them at a distance, but you really really do not want Famine near
you when you have low rations. For your next ascension, bring a stack of at
least 10+ K-Rations with you.

If you have wishes available, this might be the time to use them. A horn of
plenty for food, a scroll of gold detection to find the portal, a ring of
slow digestion...

The portal will move, and so probably the best thing for you to do is move
as well to find it. Eat a Kraken/Eel corpse to sustain you while you
search. Don't worry too much about rotten corpses, you (I hope) have a
unihorn, and maybe a cure spell or potion of extra/full healing available
to dispense of deadly food poisoning....but eat fresh whenever possible.

Conflict is making you hungry faster, and doesn't really help that much on
Water, since you can retreat from the water monsters by using bubbles, and
they won't generally follow you (and if they do, many of them drop to 1 hp
on land, and are easily killed). If you stumble on the portal to the Astral
while wearing conflict, you'll also get the less good result as far as
angels, and on your first ascension, you want all the help you can get. Are
arch/master liches genocided? If they aren't, then you'll have a bunch of
those waiting for you on the Astral too, so it won't be a picnic.


